  "findings": [
    "RM section 10.5.4 requires EPOD enabled and ready before SYSCLK above 55 MHz in voltage ranges 1 or 2.",
    "The clock feeding EPOD must be 4 to 16 MHz. Installed MSIS 4 MHz / PLLM1 uses PLL1MBOOST division1, encoded0.",
    "Require PWR_VOSR BOOSTEN and BOOSTRDY both1 and RCC_PLL1CFGR PLL1MBOOST masked0. Do not set these shared controls from power HAL.",
    "EPOD PWR BOOSTEN1 is distinct from analog switch SYSCFG BOOSTEN0; both conditions are required for the narrow nominal profile."
  ],
